WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.189
"What?" the queen shouted at her mirror.

2
00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:10.159
"Who is more beautiful than I am?"

3
00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:15.640
"Snow White, My Lady," the mirror said.

4
00:00:15.641 --> 00:00:19.678
The queen was very angry.

5
00:00:19.679 --> 00:00:24.817
"Everyone says Snow White is so pretty!

6
00:00:24.818 --> 00:00:28.839
She's so nice, so perfect!

7
00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:44.249
Well, they will stop saying it soon!"

8
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:50.964
That night the queen met a hunter in the village.

9
00:00:50.965 --> 00:00:54.235
He carried an ax.

10
00:00:54.236 --> 00:00:58.045
The queen whispered in his ear.

11
00:00:58.046 --> 00:01:04.806
Then she slipped some gold coins into his hand.

12
00:01:04.807 --> 00:01:09.679
The next day Snow White walked through the village.

13
00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:13.366
A stranger grabbed her.

14
00:01:13.367 --> 00:01:17.144
"Let me go!" Snow White cried.

15
00:01:17.145 --> 00:01:22.063
It was the hunter.

16
00:01:22.064 --> 00:01:25.706
He threw Snow White onto a horse.

17
00:01:25.707 --> 00:01:32.762
"Ya!" he cried as he jumped on.

18
00:01:32.763 --> 00:01:36.040
The horse reached a dark forest.

19
00:01:36.041 --> 00:01:40.166
Snow White saw black, tangled branches.

20
00:01:40.167 --> 00:01:43.393
Then something else caught her eye.

21
00:01:43.394 --> 00:01:47.045
An ax hung from the hunter's belt.

22
00:01:47.046 --> 00:01:50.204
Snow White gulped.

23
00:01:50.205 --> 00:01:52.567
"Please, sir! Let me go!

24
00:01:52.568 --> 00:01:55.369
I haven't done anything wrong!"

25
00:01:55.370 --> 00:01:58.640
Tears slipped down her cheeks.

26
00:01:58.641 --> 00:02:09.779
The hunter sighed and stopped the horse.

27
00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:16.686
"You poor child," he said.

28
00:02:16.687 --> 00:02:20.470
"Go. But don't ever return home.

29
00:02:20.471 --> 00:02:23.059
The queen wants you dead!"

30
00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:27.915
Snow White gasped. "Why?"

31
00:02:27.916 --> 00:02:31.272
"It doesn't matter," the hunter said.

32
00:02:31.273 --> 00:02:37.402
"Just go!"

33
00:02:37.403 --> 00:02:42.956
Snow White disappeared among the trees.

34
00:02:42.957 --> 00:02:46.862
"Poor Snow White," the hunter thought.

35
00:02:46.863 --> 00:02:54.421
"She will never survive in this forest."

